{"title":"2026 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/6/d7635421adde9fc01e72aeee002d5e65e3b73f8b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{101^{2} - 101}{100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"90\" height=\"41\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/8/e1889052eb8ebd02bf515bc01967e84bdc736664.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 101 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 1 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 100 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 0 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 10~200$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"466\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/3/1b37ba79e8f7e6ebb65038e38fb41fbbcc8ca909.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{101^{2} - 101}{100} = \\frac{10201 - 101}{100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"213\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/4/bb4ce700453815f5019661c70a66f20e62931463.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{10100}{100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"70\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/0/590033d5ed538df8779a1947a93bbf192c85eae4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{\\textbf {(A) } 101}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"95\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Factoring <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/b/94bb6fb7a3ff722532798b45607025254679e7b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$101$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/4/684c0ff7916fc029f567cc983f60f736415d0f2a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{101(101 - 1)}{100} = \\frac{101 \\times 100}{100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"211\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/0/590033d5ed538df8779a1947a93bbf192c85eae4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{\\textbf {(A) } 101}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"95\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Fermat\" title=\"2026 CEMC Fermat\">2026 CEMC Fermat</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Fermat_Problems\" title=\"2026 CEMC Fermat Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Fermat_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 CEMC Fermat Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_F